# @DIST@

Typed [msgspec](https://github.com/jcrist/msgspec) models for OCSF @OCSF@, generated by
[ocsf-toolkit](https://github.com/k4otix/ocsf-toolkit) @VERSION@. Do not edit: regenerate.

```python
from ocsf_toolkit import build
from @PACKAGE@ import DetectionFinding
```

Classes are supersets: attributes that a profile or an extension adds are optional, and
`ocsf_toolkit.build()` enforces what the active profiles require. `ocsf-toolkit generate
--profiles` emits exact classes for one profile set.
